/// <summary>
/// Feature: Ambiguous Protocol Dispatch — Contributing Extension (Namespace Alpha).
/// Declares a Point.DoWork() extension that, together with Beta's same-signature
/// extension, makes protocol dispatch ambiguous for the ProtocolAmbiguityFail case.
/// </summary>
/// <remarks>
/// Compiler Target: ValidationPass (Structural Candidate Gathering, 3-Key Namespace Walk).
/// Role: One of two same-signature contributions driven by main.cvl in this folder.
